# Probe walk; publish manual captures with capture_manual.py midi-scales.
# MIDI Scales: start from a sample-free project in audio mode, KEY OFF.
# MIDI -> track 1 -> FUNC + AMP (ARP SETUP); encoder F is KEY.
# Press F to enable KEY from OFF before turning it.
# Four raw encoder counts select one choice; modes are grouped by key.
key 0x35
key 0x10
chord 0x2d 0x23
wait 1.0
shot midi-scales/key-off
key 0x3d
wait 1.0
enc 5 4
wait 1.0
shot midi-scales/c-major
enc 5 4
wait 1.0
shot midi-scales/c-dorian
enc 5 4
enc 5 4
enc 5 4
wait 1.0
shot midi-scales/c-mixolydian
